\**{c=red:Note:}** This Mission is optional and can be skipped by trading enough {p:Crystals|Crystal} to the {p:Conquest NPC}.
* This mission can not be soloed unless you already have access to Toraimarai Canal. If you have to pass the Three Mage Gate without an alternate option, then it cannot be soloed. Completing this mission allows you to obtain the {@k} {k:Portal charm} for passing the {p:Three Mage Gate} by yourself afterwards.
** Alternatively, you may complete this solo later at a higher rank or start the quest {q:Toraimarai Turmoil|Toraimarai Turmoil|Toraimarai Turmoil}. See the notes at the end of the page.

=2 Walkthrough
This Mission __is__ skippable. Should you skip it and obtain a higher rank, completing this mission will be different. See the notes at the end of the page.{br}If you choose not to skip this mission, check the {p:Three Mage Gate} page for details on your options.
* Accept the mission and make your way to {z:Heavens Tower}.
* Pass by {n:Kupipi} and on to the second floor. Speak to {p:Zubaba} who will give you the {@k} {k:Charm of light}.
* Next, you will need to get past the **Three Mage Gate** in ruins tower at (J-7) in {z:East Sarutabaruta} (this is the same tower as the {p:Survival Guide} {z:Inner Horutoto Ruins} warp).
* Pass the **Three Mage Gate** (inside Inner Horutoto Ruins) and continue on to the small room at (G-7).
* Check the **Gate of Light** at G-7 map 4 for a cutscene.
* Return to **Heavens Tower** and speak to {p:Zubaba} to finish the mission.

\**{c=red:Note:}** {p:Zubaba} does not give you the {@k} {k:Portal charm}. To obtain it, finish the mission and trade a {i:Rolanberry|Rolanberry|4365} to {n:Kupipi}. You may trade Kupipi the {i:Rolanberry|Rolanberry|4365} mid-mission, but she will not give you the {k:Portal charm} until you talk to her again after the mission is completed.
=3 Repeating or Skipping the Mission
This Mission will work differently if: you have skipped this Mission and obtained a higher Home Nation Rank after completing {M:The Final Seal|The Final Seal|The Final Seal}, or are simply repeating it.
* Accept the mission and speak to {p:Zubaba}. She will ask for you to bring her 3 {p:Rusty Daggers|Rusty Dagger}. These can be purchased on the Auction House (but may be rare), or obtained from the {m:Wendigos|Wendigo} past the **Three Mage Gate** (the same skeletons that drop {i:Test Answers|Test Answers|544}.)
* Trade Zubaba the daggers to complete the mission. Obtaining the {@k} {k:Portal charm} is done the same way as completing the mission regularly.

